WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.722 --> 00:00:07.522
&gt;&gt; Greg: DID YOU HEAR THE ONE

00:00:07.523 --> 00:00:08.657
ABOUT THE PASSENGER YANKED FROM

00:00:08.658 --> 00:00:10.392
A SOUTHWEST AIRLINES FLIGHT FOR

00:00:10.393 --> 00:00:10.992
MAKING A JOKE?

00:00:10.993 --> 00:00:13.228
THE FLIGHT FROM SACRAMENTO TO

00:00:13.229 --> 00:00:15.530
AUSTIN, TEXAS, HAD BEEN DELAYED

00:00:15.531 --> 00:00:16.798
FOR HOURS WHICH SPURRED FLIGHT

00:00:16.799 --> 00:00:18.433
ATTENDANTS TO HAND OUT WATER.

00:00:18.434 --> 00:00:20.502
ONE PASSENGER ASKED IF IT WAS

00:00:20.503 --> 00:00:20.969
VODKA.

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:21.903
THE YOUNG FLIGHT ATTENDANT

00:00:21.904 --> 00:00:23.305
DIDN'T FIND IT FUNNY AND DESPITE

00:00:23.306 --> 00:00:24.539
FELLOW PASSENGERS DEFENDING THE

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:27.075
JOKER, THE PLANE WAS TURNED

00:00:27.076 --> 00:00:27.776
BACK.

00:00:27.777 --> 00:00:28.610
DEPUTIES BOARDED THE VESSEL AND

00:00:28.611 --> 00:00:30.011
EXPORTED THE GUY OFF.

00:00:30.012 --> 00:00:31.847
AT LEAST HE FOUND A WAY TO GET

00:00:31.848 --> 00:00:33.949
OFF THE PLANE IN TIME.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:34.983
SOUTHWEST SERVES MILLIONS OF

00:00:34.984 --> 00:00:35.917
PASSENGERS SO MAYBE THIS

00:00:35.918 --> 00:00:37.185
HUMORLESS THIS IS AN EXCEPTION

00:00:37.186 --> 00:00:39.955
FOR A COMPANY ONCE KNOWN FOR ITS

00:00:39.956 --> 00:00:41.390
IRREVERENCE.

00:00:41.391 --> 00:00:42.724
THE INCIDENT IS NO LONGER OUT OF

00:00:42.725 --> 00:00:43.325
THE ORDINARY FOR LIFE IN

00:00:43.326 --> 00:00:43.658
GENERAL.

00:00:43.659 --> 00:00:45.327
FOR SO MANY PEOPLE WHO CAME OF

00:00:45.328 --> 00:00:48.263
AGE BUT NEVER GREW UP IN THE ERA

00:00:48.264 --> 00:00:49.598
OF SAFE SPACES, JOKES ARE VIEWED

00:00:49.599 --> 00:00:52.934
AS ACTUAL OFFENSES.

00:00:52.935 --> 00:00:54.503
OFFENSES, AGGRESSIONS.

00:00:54.504 --> 00:00:56.204
TRIGGER WARNINGS ARE ENCOURAGED

00:00:56.205 --> 00:00:58.707
BEFORE STUDENTS SEE CHALLENGING

00:00:58.708 --> 00:00:59.007
PLAYS.

00:00:59.008 --> 00:01:01.576
COMEDY SETS ARE STOPPED IF ONE

00:01:01.577 --> 00:01:02.711
JOKE HURTS ONE ACTIVISTS

00:01:02.712 --> 00:01:03.378
FEELINGS.

00:01:03.379 --> 00:01:04.446
GOOD COMEDIANS AVOID COLLEGES

00:01:04.447 --> 00:01:04.846
ALTOGETHER.

00:01:04.847 --> 00:01:05.947
WE HAVE A GENERATION THAT FAILS

00:01:05.948 --> 00:01:08.116
TO SEE HUMOR IS ONE EFFECTIVE

00:01:08.117 --> 00:01:09.985
TOOL IN REDUCING TENSION IN

00:01:09.986 --> 00:01:10.986
STRESSFUL EVENTS, LIKE A PLANE

00:01:10.987 --> 00:01:14.656
STUCK ON A RUNWAY OR STOCK ON

00:01:14.657 --> 00:01:15.056
"THE FIVE."

00:01:15.057 --> 00:01:18.560
IF HUMANS CAN NO LONGER SEE

00:01:18.561 --> 00:01:19.928
HUMOR'S VALUE AND REDUCING

00:01:19.929 --> 00:01:21.363
HOSTILITY, WHAT ARE WE LEFT

00:01:21.364 --> 00:01:22.030
WITH?

00:01:22.031 --> 00:01:22.397
HOSTILITY.

00:01:22.398 --> 00:01:24.566
LIFE USED TO BE LIKE THIS.

00:01:24.567 --> 00:01:25.367
FUNNY, TRUTHFUL, SHOCKING.

00:01:25.368 --> 00:01:27.669
NOW IT'S LIKE THIS.

00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:31.273
SCOLDING, SELF SERIOUS,

00:01:31.274 --> 00:01:32.674
COMMUNITY AND AS SCHOOLMARM.

00:01:32.675 --> 00:01:34.109
IT IS THE SETH MEYERS EFFECT, A

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:36.511
JOKE WAS LIFE BECOMES MUNDANE

00:01:36.512 --> 00:01:37.946
AND PALE EVEN LATE AT NIGHT.

00:01:37.947 --> 00:01:40.115
YET HE STILL HAS A SHOW.

00:01:40.116 --> 00:01:43.285
NOW THAT'S AN UNFUNNY PUNCH LIN

00:01:43.286 --> 00:01:43.785
PUNCH LINE.

00:01:43.786 --> 00:01:46.354
CAN'T DO JOKES ANYMORE ON THE

00:01:46.355 --> 00:01:46.788
PLANE, DANA.

00:01:46.789 --> 00:01:48.557
&gt;&gt; Dana: THIS A COUPLE THINGS

00:01:48.558 --> 00:01:49.691
THAT YOU CAN'T JOKE ABOUT ON A

00:01:49.692 --> 00:01:50.926
PLANE.

00:01:50.927 --> 00:01:52.394
BUT EVERYTHING ELSE SHOULD BE

00:01:52.395 --> 00:01:53.361
WITHIN THE LIMITS.

00:01:53.362 --> 00:01:55.330
THE OTHER THING IS, SOUTHWEST

00:01:55.331 --> 00:01:57.466
DOES HAVE PRETTY GREAT STAFF.

00:01:57.467 --> 00:01:58.834
THIS SEEMS REALLY WEIRD.

00:01:58.835 --> 00:01:59.935
&gt;&gt; Greg: I THINK -- I DON'T

00:01:59.936 --> 00:02:01.670
WANT TO BE AGEIST BUT I THINK

00:02:01.671 --> 00:02:03.004
IT'S YOUNG PEOPLE.

00:02:03.005 --> 00:02:05.507
ALL YOUNG PEOPLE ARE BAD,

00:02:05.508 --> 00:02:06.341
SHANNON.

00:02:06.342 --> 00:02:07.542
CAN I SAY THAT LEGALLY?

00:02:07.543 --> 00:02:09.244
&gt;&gt; Shannon: YES, YOU CAN RIGHT

00:02:09.245 --> 00:02:10.412
IT'S YOUR OPINION.

00:02:10.413 --> 00:02:12.814
ONE OF MY FAVORITE SHOWS, "THE

00:02:12.815 --> 00:02:13.582
OFFICE," YOU COULDN'T MAKE THAT

00:02:13.583 --> 00:02:16.551
SHOW NOW.

00:02:16.552 --> 00:02:20.655
I JUST FEEL LIKE WHEN I SEE THE

00:02:20.656 --> 00:02:21.089
OLD EPISODES.

00:02:21.090 --> 00:02:22.924
&gt;&gt; Dana: A LOT OF MENLO MEALS

00:02:22.925 --> 00:02:24.659
DO WATCH THAT.

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:26.995
&gt;&gt; Shannon: HOW ARE THEY NOT

00:02:26.996 --> 00:02:27.395
PASSED OUT?

00:02:27.396 --> 00:02:29.631
&gt;&gt; Greg: EVEN STUFF ON

00:02:29.632 --> 00:02:30.932
"FRIENDS" YOU CAN'T BELIEVE

00:02:30.933 --> 00:02:32.300
THAT'S HAPPENING.

00:02:32.301 --> 00:02:34.836
MAYBE WE ARE BETTER PEOPLE NOW,

00:02:34.837 --> 00:02:36.171
MORE ENLIGHTENED, JUAN.

00:02:36.172 --> 00:02:38.306
WE ARE SO ENLIGHTENED WE DON'T

00:02:38.307 --> 00:02:39.040
NEED JOKES ANYMORE.

00:02:39.041 --> 00:02:41.543
&gt;&gt; Juan: I DON'T KNOW.

00:02:41.544 --> 00:02:43.912
I AM A BIG LENNY BRUCE FAN.

00:02:43.913 --> 00:02:46.982
I LIKE RICHARD PRYOR, RED FOX.

00:02:46.983 --> 00:02:47.782
THEY PUT SOME OF THOSE GUYS IN

00:02:47.783 --> 00:02:50.252
JAIL BACK THEN.

00:02:50.253 --> 00:02:53.722
I'M NOT SURE WE WERE ALWAYS FULL

00:02:53.723 --> 00:02:55.056
OF HUMOR.

00:02:55.057 --> 00:02:56.224
THE IDEA THERE WAS TO ABSOLUTELY

00:02:56.225 --> 00:02:59.895
PUSH THE LINE, SKEWERED

00:02:59.896 --> 00:03:00.729
CONVENTIONAL THINKING IN

00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:01.062
AMERICA.

00:03:01.063 --> 00:03:02.063
THEY WOULD PUT PEOPLE IN JAIL.

00:03:02.064 --> 00:03:04.132
WE DON'T DO THAT.

00:03:04.133 --> 00:03:05.433
IT MAKES ME THINK, JESSE

00:03:05.434 --> 00:03:07.068
SOMETHING ELSE WAS GOING ON

00:03:07.069 --> 00:03:08.169
BETWEEN THE FLIGHT ATTENDANT AND

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:08.770
THAT PERSON.

00:03:08.771 --> 00:03:10.939
&gt;&gt; Jesse: DO YOU THINK THEY

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:11.373
HAD A HISTORY?

00:03:11.374 --> 00:03:11.940
&gt;&gt; Juan: I DON'T KNOW.

00:03:11.941 --> 00:03:14.009
&gt;&gt; Greg: I WAS WONDERING ABOUT

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:14.309
THAT.

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:16.177
I FOUND OUT OTHER PEOPLE ON THE

00:03:16.178 --> 00:03:17.178
PLANE WERE SHOCKED BY THIS.

00:03:17.179 --> 00:03:18.747
I WAS SINGING MAYBE THERE WAS

00:03:18.748 --> 00:03:22.083
SOMETHING GOING ON, SOMETHING

00:03:22.084 --> 00:03:22.951
ELSE GOING ON.

00:03:22.952 --> 00:03:24.319
&gt;&gt; Juan: MAYBE IT WAS HIS TONE

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:26.354
OR MAYBE HE HAD SPILLED

00:03:26.355 --> 00:03:26.988
SOMETHING ON HER FOOT.

00:03:26.989 --> 00:03:27.889
&gt;&gt; Jesse: TONE IS IMPORTANT

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:29.324
AND I WOULD HAVE TO DISAGREE

00:03:29.325 --> 00:03:31.326
WITH YOU ABOUT LOCKING PEOPLE UP

00:03:31.327 --> 00:03:32.494
FOR TELLING JOKES.

00:03:32.495 --> 00:03:33.628
TRUMP JOKED THAT RUSSIA, IF

00:03:33.629 --> 00:03:36.097
YOU'RE LISTENING, HILLARY'S

00:03:36.098 --> 00:03:37.499
EMAILS.

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:38.934
THAT WAS IN THE MUELLER REPORT

00:03:38.935 --> 00:03:40.902
AS A POTENTIAL OBSTRUCTION

00:03:40.903 --> 00:03:42.370
CHARGE.

00:03:42.371 --> 00:03:45.774
THAT'S HOW SERIOUSLY THEY TOOK

00:03:45.775 --> 00:03:46.575
HIS JOKE.

00:03:46.576 --> 00:03:49.411
&gt;&gt; Greg: I SEE IT.

00:03:49.412 --> 00:03:50.211
[LAUGHTER]

00:03:50.212 --> 00:03:50.946
&gt;&gt; Jesse: COME ON.

00:03:50.947 --> 00:03:52.514
&gt;&gt; Juan: ESPECIALLY WHEN THE

00:03:52.515 --> 00:03:53.481
INVESTIGATORS COME OUT.

00:03:53.482 --> 00:03:54.883
TAKE IT AS A JOKE.

00:03:54.884 --> 00:03:57.919
&gt;&gt; Greg: HERE IS THE BIG

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:58.353
PROBLEM.

00:03:58.354 --> 00:03:59.254
YOU HAVE YOUNG PEOPLE WHO HAVE A

00:03:59.255 --> 00:04:02.991
PROBLEM WITH JOKES.

00:04:02.992 --> 00:04:05.126
IF IT'S NOT FUNNY TO THEM, THEN

00:04:05.127 --> 00:04:06.294
IT'S OFFENSIVE AND THAT'S THE

00:04:06.295 --> 00:04:08.229
TOOL THAT KEEPS SOCIETY GOING.

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:09.664
IT'S A LUBRICATION.

00:04:09.665 --> 00:04:11.633
IF YOU ARE IN A MEETING AND YOU

00:04:11.634 --> 00:04:13.702
NEED -- LET'S SAY A MEETING

00:04:13.703 --> 00:04:14.369
BETWEEN TRIBES.

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:16.171
I'M SURE HUMOR WAS THE TOOL THAT

00:04:16.172 --> 00:04:17.839
KEPT YOU FROM KILLING EACH

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:18.173
OTHER.

00:04:18.174 --> 00:04:19.774
AND THAT'S WHAT SCARES ME.

00:04:19.775 --> 00:04:21.810
&gt;&gt; Juan: IS THIS EVEN A BAD

00:04:21.811 --> 00:04:22.110
JOKE?

00:04:22.111 --> 00:04:24.646
IT WASN'T OFFENSIVE.

00:04:24.647 --> 00:04:26.915
&gt;&gt; Greg: WAITING HERE FOR A

00:04:26.916 --> 00:04:29.351
COUPLE HOURS, LET'S HOPE IT'S

00:04:29.352 --> 00:04:30.986
VODKA.

00:04:30.987 --> 00:04:32.387
&gt;&gt; Juan: HOW IS THAT

00:04:32.388 --> 00:04:32.921
OFFENSIVE?

00:04:32.922 --> 00:04:35.056
&gt;&gt; Shannon: SHE SAID I DON'T

00:04:35.057 --> 00:04:36.925
FIND THAT FUNNY.

00:04:36.926 --> 00:04:37.525
&gt;&gt; Dana: OKAY, FINE.

00:04:37.526 --> 00:04:38.994
YOU TELL THEM TO TURN AROUND THE

00:04:38.995 --> 00:04:40.328
PLANE AND YOU RUIN EVERYBODY

00:04:40.329 --> 00:04:44.666
ELSE'S DAY?

00:04:44.667 --> 00:04:45.934
&gt;&gt; Shannon: MAYBE IT'S TRUE

00:04:45.935 --> 00:04:48.703
THAT WE THINK OUR JOKES THAT ARE

00:04:48.704 --> 00:04:50.238
HILARIOUS AND WONDERFUL, WE ARE

00:04:50.239 --> 00:04:50.639
GETTING OLD.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:52.741
I MADE A JOKE ABOUT CARMEN

00:04:52.742 --> 00:04:53.274
MIRANDA YESTERDAY.

00:04:53.275 --> 00:04:54.976
EVERYONE WAS LOOKING AT ME.

00:04:54.977 --> 00:04:56.211
NO ONE KNOWS WHO IT IS.

00:04:56.212 --> 00:04:58.680
&gt;&gt; Greg: SHE WAS A FLAMENCO

00:04:58.681 --> 00:04:59.014
DANCER.

00:04:59.015 --> 00:05:03.051
&gt;&gt; Jesse: I HAVE NO IDEA.

00:05:03.052 --> 00:05:04.753
&gt;&gt; Jesse: WHO?

00:05:04.754 --> 00:05:06.755
CARMEN SANDIEGO?

00:05:06.756 --> 00:05:09.290
&gt;&gt; Juan: YOU KNEW WHEN TRUMP

00:05:09.291 --> 00:05:10.492
TOLD THE JOKE.

00:05:10.493 --> 00:05:11.126
&gt;&gt; Jesse: "MAD" MAGAZINE.

00:05:11.127 --> 00:05:14.629
&gt;&gt; Greg: IT'S THE FACT THAT WE

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:15.964
ARE RAISING, WE ARE RAISING

00:05:15.965 --> 00:05:17.265
CHILDREN IN THEIR SAFE CAGES SO

00:05:17.266 --> 00:05:19.868
IF THEY GO OUTSIDE, SOMETHING --

00:05:19.869 --> 00:05:20.902
&gt;&gt; Jesse: IT WASN'T JUST THAT

00:05:20.903 --> 00:05:22.837
SHE DIDN'T LIKE THE JOKE.

00:05:22.838 --> 00:05:24.272
SHE ABUSED HER POWER AND KICKED

00:05:24.273 --> 00:05:25.140
HIM OFF.

00:05:25.141 --> 00:05:26.474
&gt;&gt; Dana: THAT'S THE OTHER

00:05:26.475 --> 00:05:26.775
THING.

00:05:26.776 --> 00:05:28.610
&gt;&gt; Greg: I HOPE WE DON'T FIND

00:05:28.611 --> 00:05:29.377
OUT MORE ABOUT THE STORY AND IT

00:05:29.378 --> 00:05:30.278
TURNS OUT TO BECOME TIGHTLY

00:05:30.279 --> 00:05:30.612
WRONG.

00:05:30.613 --> 00:05:33.348
I REALLY DON'T WANT TO DO A

00:05:33.349 --> 00:05:34.015
CORRECTION.

00:05:34.016 --> 00:05:34.949
&gt;&gt; Jesse: I HANDLE THE

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:35.850
CORRECTIONS.

00:05:35.851 --> 00:05:39.388
&gt;&gt; Greg: ASKED, JESSE DOES ALL

